@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+## Context
+`applyPatch`, `jsonEqual`, and `cloneJson` already exist in `src/index.ts`.
+
+## Decisions
+- Recursive diff: objects compare by key (remove, then add/replace/recurse); differing types or primitives yield `replace`.
+- Arrays: compute an LCS of items by deep equality, giving removes and adds. Where a removed and an added item land at the same position, recurse into them instead. Operations are emitted so indices are valid when applied in order (walk with a running index).
+- Values in operations are cloned with `cloneJson`.
+- Moves/copies are not generated.
